			"Message": "fix(Documentation): Correct GitHub source links — /tree/ only, absolute element repo paths\n\nAll links verified against on-disk paths. /blob/ → /tree/ rule enforced.\nLICENSE and CHANGELOG links now point to specific files, not bare repo roots.\n\nGenerated-By: PostHog Code\nTask-Id: 88c0b3de-fc57-4c33-b3af-3a7b47e0c4e1",
