			"Message": "docs(Grove): Update documentation links to use Editor.Land capitalization\n\nThe README.md references to Grove documentation, architecture overview, and WebAssembly rationale used lowercase 'editor.land' URLs. Update all three links to use the proper 'Editor.Land' capitalization matching the project's canonical domain presentation.\n\nThis ensures consistency with the official branding across all Grove documentation entry points.",
